   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN-Women - Accountability for CRSV: Sustaining Momentum to End Impunity - Phase II - 2025-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The strategic focus of the development cooperation is to contribute to UN accountability mechanisms systematically document and report on conflict-related sexual violence (CRSV) and other violations of women&#x2019;s rights, leading to enhanced policy responses and contributing to justice initiatives that improve survivors&apos; access to justice and redress.</narrative>
